{"title":"牧羊人","url":"https://www.shephe.com/","favicon":"https://www.shephe.com/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"WordPress 利用 PHP Exif 扩展实现图片元信息展示","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/wordpress-php-exif-image-meta-display/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">WordPress 利用 PHP Exif 扩展实现图片元信息展示</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Media2.webp 1536w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Media2-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-10-26T09:51:12+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t10/26/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>WordPress 利用 PHP Exif 扩展实现图片元信息展示</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>作为一个摄影爱好者（伪），我一直希望能在博客上方便、快速地展示照片的 EXIF 信息。EXIF（Exchangeable Image File Format）是嵌入在数码照片文件中的一组元数据，它记录了拍摄时的关键信息，例如快门速度、光圈值…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/wordpress-php-exif-image-meta-display/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/wordpress-php-exif-image-meta-display/","retrieved":1761500765564},{"title":"简单实现 WordPress 评论点赞、排序和前台编辑","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href