ass=\"screen-reader-text\">使用 Cloudflare R2 + Pages 搭建免费图床，并集成到 WordPress 评论系统</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cloudflare.png 1460w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cloudflare-768x384.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-10-19T14:20:53+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t10/19/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>使用 Cloudflare R2 + Pages 搭建免费图床，并集成到 WordPress 评论系统</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在去年的博客年度更新日志中，我提到本站的评论框功能过于单薄，只能输入纯文本，我一直希望能为它加入更丰富的交互体验——比如支持加粗、斜体、删除线，能上传图片、添加 Emoji 符号等。 一年后的这个国庆假期，我终于抽时间把它完善了。最终实现的…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/wordpress-comment-image-upload-cloudflare/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/wordpress-comment-image-upload-cloudflare/","retrieved":1760895866021},{"title":"Adobe Premiere Elements 和 Premiere 的区别是什么","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-premiere-elements-vs-pr/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Adobe Premiere Elements 和 Premiere 的区别是什么</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div cla